Modifications in Zedless
------------------------

Zedless is derived from the upstream source above and is distributed under the
same license. The following categories of changes were made:

- Product identity: Zedless name, application id, config/data directories,
  icons and window titles.
- Removed or disabled: agent panel and sidebar, ACP tools, AI providers,
  Copilot, inline assist, edit prediction, web search, collaboration panel,
  calls/channels UI, feedback UI, crash reporter sidecar, telemetry upload,
  upstream auto-updater, onboarding flow, extension auto-install and store
  surfaces, collaboration settings pages, sign-in and profile UI.
- Added: Linux build/install scripts, memory benchmark script, release
  packaging and documentation.
- Changed defaults: local-only operation, Vulkan-only rendering on Linux and
  Vulkan ICD restriction to the primary GPU.

